From f7e839d8c644b9696c7b6f81092f1ad1e8bc860f Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: engine_harness_unreal <noreply@anthropic.com>
Date: Tue, 3 Nov 2026 00:36:30 +0000
Subject: [PATCH 9/9] Guide people who have never made a game through the game
 studio

The system prompt tells the agent to load the game-studio skill when
someone wants to make a game, is new to game development, or works in a
studio game's folder.
---
 ...gents__prompt_manager__tests__all_platform_extensions.snap | 4 ++++
 .../goose__agents__prompt_manager__tests__basic.snap          | 4 ++++
 .../goose__agents__prompt_manager__tests__one_extension.snap  | 4 ++++
 .../goose__agents__prompt_manager__tests__typical_setup.snap  | 4 ++++
 crates/goose/src/prompts/system.md                            | 4 ++++
 5 files changed, 20 insertions(+)

diff --git a/crates/goose/src/agents/snapshots/goose__agents__prompt_manager__tests__all_platform_extensions.snap b/crates/goose/src/agents/snapshots/goose__agents__prompt_manager__tests__all_platform_extensions.snap
index 116e7db..d45655f 100644
--- a/crates/goose/src/agents/snapshots/goose__agents__prompt_manager__tests__all_platform_extensions.snap
+++ b/crates/goose/src/agents/snapshots/goose__agents__prompt_manager__tests__all_platform_extensions.snap
@@ -10,6 +10,10 @@ You work with game developers on their own computer, in the tools they have open
 They playtest what you build in the editor and tell you what to change; that loop is the work. Keep each change small
 enough to try in Play in Editor, say exactly what to try, and wait for their verdict before building on it.
 
+Many people who come to you have never made a game. When someone wants to make a game, is new to game development, or
+works in a folder with a studio game (design/game.json), load the game-studio skill and follow it: it takes them from an
+idea to a game they can share, one question at a time, with a skill for each step.
+
 - Before making an asset, read the Game Harness conventions for its kind: Unreal naming (SM_, T_, BP_, SFX_), UCX_ collision
   named after its mesh, metric units at scale 1.0 exported as centimetres, pivots, texture colour spaces.
 - Before editing a binary file (.blend, .uasset, .umap, .wav, .wwu), lock it with the Game Harness, and unlock it when done.
